WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:44.087
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:44.357 --> 00:48.069
‎DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE

3
01:22.562 --> 01:23.438
‎Stay here.

4
01:34.532 --> 01:36.034
‎I'll get your brother out.

5
02:37.387 --> 02:39.847
‎EPISODE 2

6
02:39.931 --> 02:42.892
‎The surgery press release goes out today.

7
02:44.686 --> 02:45.520
‎Director Bu.

8
02:46.104 --> 02:48.189
‎We were able to expand ‎the pediatric cancer ward

9
02:48.273 --> 02:50.441
‎thanks to this gentleman's donation.

10
02:50.525 --> 02:53.653
‎As the only branch running at a deficit--

11
02:53.736 --> 02:55.071
‎He's definitely a patient.

12
02:55.738 --> 02:56.948
‎In more ways than one.

13
02:57.949 --> 03:00.451
‎The foundation's hospitals ‎net tens of billions of won.

14
03:00.535 --> 03:03.663
‎Do we still need to cater to VIP donors?

15
03:04.914 --> 03:07.709
‎The surgical staff room expansion ‎is on hold right now,

16
03:07.792 --> 03:10.003
‎and the foundation ‎won't give us an answer.

17
03:10.086 --> 03:12.755
‎Please put together ‎the past donation records.

18
03:13.756 --> 03:15.883
‎We should be doing upfront chemo.

19
03:15.967 --> 03:18.511
‎Why are we doing surgery first, Dr. Do?

20
03:19.345 --> 03:21.764
‎The patient insists on it.

21
03:22.640 --> 03:23.850
‎I can't persuade him.

22
03:24.517 --> 03:26.894
‎He says he needs to stay sharp right now.

23
03:26.978 --> 03:29.022
‎You can't blame him ‎if you take a look outside…

24
03:29.105 --> 03:30.898
‎WAGE WITHHOLDING, MISMANAGEMENT, ‎AND ABUSE OF POWER

25
03:30.982 --> 03:32.275
‎He just arrived.

26
03:32.358 --> 03:33.818
‎Dr. Ma Seong-gyu is downstairs.

27
03:33.901 --> 03:34.736
‎Dr. Do.

28
03:37.780 --> 03:39.073
‎Can you do it?

29
03:47.749 --> 03:49.042
‎MONTHLY RENTALS AVAILABLE

30
03:49.125 --> 03:50.209
‎1.5 MILLION PER MONTH (NEGOTIABLE)

31
03:50.293 --> 03:51.794
‎It's 1.5 million won a month?

32
03:53.629 --> 03:54.714
‎So freaking expensive.

33
04:00.053 --> 04:02.305
‎GUSEO UNIVERSITY SEONAM MEDICAL CENTER

34
04:07.268 --> 04:09.479
‎Park Gwang-cheol, step down!

35
04:09.562 --> 04:11.898
‎-Step down! ‎-Step down!

36
04:11.981 --> 04:13.483
‎Stop withholding wages!

37
04:13.566 --> 04:15.902
‎-Stop withholding! ‎-Stop withholding!

38
04:15.985 --> 04:17.695
‎Park Gwang-cheol, get out!

39
04:17.779 --> 04:19.864
‎-Get out! ‎-Get out!

40
04:19.947 --> 04:21.991
‎Stop withholding wages!

41
04:22.075 --> 04:24.243
‎-Stop withholding! ‎-Stop withholding!

42
04:29.499 --> 04:32.502
‎Are you here for yourself, ‎or is someone else sick?

43
04:33.503 --> 04:35.088
‎-No, thank you. ‎-Just take it.

44
04:35.171 --> 04:37.298
‎Think of me as your grandma and eat it.

45
04:45.848 --> 04:48.768
‎I can eat that without a problem.

46
04:51.604 --> 04:52.522
‎Thank you.

47
04:59.654 --> 05:02.073
‎Stop withholding wages!

48
05:02.156 --> 05:03.950
‎-Stop withholding! ‎-There he is!

49
05:18.214 --> 05:19.340
‎We're patients too.

50
05:19.424 --> 05:20.842
‎Look, he's going inside.

51
05:20.925 --> 05:23.261
‎-We're all patients here. ‎-All of us are here to see a doctor.

52
05:23.344 --> 05:24.178
‎We're patients too!

53
05:26.055 --> 05:27.265
‎Let me ask you something.

54
05:27.849 --> 05:29.016
‎Yes, sir.

55
05:29.684 --> 05:31.519
‎I'm really sick, aren't I?

56
05:31.602 --> 05:33.729
‎I actually have cancer?

57
05:33.813 --> 05:35.022
‎Yes, you have cancer.

58
05:35.606 --> 05:37.358
‎No one believes me.

59
05:37.442 --> 05:41.028
‎I've faked being sick ‎to dodge the parliamentary audit.

60
05:41.571 --> 05:44.615
‎And I faked collapsing ‎to postpone my trial.

61
05:45.241 --> 05:47.577
‎Now that I'm actually sick…

62
05:48.703 --> 05:51.873
‎I can barely stand, ‎but they're kicking up a fuss.

63
05:51.956 --> 05:54.083
‎Getting stressed ‎will make your condition worse.

64
05:54.167 --> 05:56.294
‎Dr. Do has in-depth knowledge ‎of treatment and management

65
05:56.377 --> 05:57.920
‎on top of excellent surgical skills.

66
05:58.004 --> 05:59.463
‎You're in good hands.

67
06:00.381 --> 06:01.757
‎You'll go far.

68
06:04.010 --> 06:06.304
‎Thank you. I'm Ma Seong-gyu, by the way.

69
06:07.597 --> 06:08.931
‎Before we go up to my room,

70
06:09.015 --> 06:11.559
‎let's stop by ‎the pediatric cancer ward I funded.

71
06:12.143 --> 06:14.478
‎I couldn't bask in the glory of it ‎because of the trial.

72
06:14.562 --> 06:16.647
‎I hear there's a plaque ‎with my name on it.

73
06:17.648 --> 06:18.983
‎Yes, sir.

74
06:23.237 --> 06:25.865
‎This is the story of a lone wolf.

75
06:26.616 --> 06:28.034
‎Hey, Gye Su-jeong.

76
06:28.117 --> 06:29.118
‎I need this.

77
06:29.911 --> 06:34.790
‎A solitary figure that has emerged ‎in the era of mafia in white,

78
06:34.874 --> 06:38.127
‎where even the practice of saving lives ‎is driven by money and power.

79
06:38.628 --> 06:39.503
‎Emergency patient!

80
06:40.129 --> 06:42.298
‎She belongs to no group.

81
06:42.381 --> 06:44.008
‎She belongs to no system.

82
06:44.091 --> 06:44.967
‎Dr. Gye!

83
06:45.051 --> 06:46.719
‎This person right here…

84
06:46.802 --> 06:47.762
‎Why that…

85
06:53.309 --> 06:55.311
‎-Gye Su-jeong! ‎-…despises authority

86
06:55.394 --> 06:58.022
‎-and answers to no one. ‎-Wait!

87
06:59.023 --> 07:01.359
‎Her only weapons are her medical license

88
07:01.442 --> 07:04.111
‎and the surgical skills ‎she has honed from the bottom up.

89
07:11.369 --> 07:12.245
‎No pneumothorax.

90
07:12.328 --> 07:13.913
‎Miss, what's your name?

91
07:13.996 --> 07:15.331
‎Lee Ju-hui.

92
07:15.957 --> 07:17.124
‎I have type 1 diabetes.

93
07:20.628 --> 07:23.256
‎-Pull up her EMR now. ‎-Yes, Doctor.

94
07:26.217 --> 07:27.468
‎This is humiliating.

95
07:28.302 --> 07:29.804
‎Who was that crazy lady?

96
07:34.517 --> 07:35.977
‎Meet Gye Su-jeong, a surgeon.

97
07:36.852 --> 07:37.895
‎Also known as‎…

98
07:39.397 --> 07:41.399
‎Doctor X.

99
07:43.067 --> 07:44.652
‎Sun and Steel's chairman, ‎Park Gwang-cheol,

100
07:44.735 --> 07:46.779
‎has allegedly faked being a patient…

101
07:46.862 --> 07:48.531
‎Man, seriously?

102
07:48.614 --> 07:51.409
‎…‎in order to suspend ‎the execution of his sentence.

103
07:51.993 --> 07:53.244
‎Are we really working with her?

104
07:53.911 --> 07:54.954
‎We have to.

105
07:55.746 --> 07:56.789
‎Director Bu decided on it,

106
07:56.872 --> 07:58.583
‎and we're short on staff.

107
07:58.666 --> 08:01.627
‎But come on, she does whatever she wants.

108
08:03.588 --> 08:04.755
‎She had an emergency patient.

109
08:04.839 --> 08:05.756
‎Well, yes.

110
08:06.257 --> 08:09.468
‎But my face is plastered ‎all over the news now.

111
08:09.969 --> 08:11.762
‎Hey, you look great on camera.

112
08:11.846 --> 08:12.972
‎Oh, come on.

113
08:14.390 --> 08:15.308
‎Hang in there.

114
08:18.311 --> 08:19.145
‎Let's get revenge.

115
08:19.979 --> 08:22.398
‎Let's throw her off so she can't focus.

116
08:22.481 --> 08:23.316
‎Okay.

117
08:32.575 --> 08:34.327
‎-Do you want coffee? ‎-Yes, coffee.

118
08:34.410 --> 08:35.745
‎Yeah, coffee.

119
08:42.918 --> 08:43.961
‎Earbuds.

120
08:51.135 --> 08:53.971
‎I need you to assist with ‎Dr. Do's surgery.

121
08:54.055 --> 08:55.139
‎You're not going in?

122
08:55.723 --> 08:57.600
‎It'd be too obvious if I went in.

123
08:57.683 --> 09:00.478
‎He'll definitely know ‎that I don't trust his surgical skills

124
09:00.561 --> 09:01.854
‎if I try to assist.

125
09:01.937 --> 09:04.315
‎But you're at the right level ‎to assist him.

126
09:04.398 --> 09:05.232
‎Sure.

127
09:05.316 --> 09:07.234
‎Anyway, how did Dr. Do end up…

128
09:07.318 --> 09:08.611
‎It happened over drinks.

129
09:09.654 --> 09:11.614
‎I guess Dr. Do was attentive to him,

130
09:11.697 --> 09:13.866
‎which put the chairman in a great mood.

131
09:13.949 --> 09:15.993
‎So he assigned Dr. Do ‎as his primary attending.

132
09:16.077 --> 09:18.371
‎He chose his primary attending ‎based on his mood?

133
09:18.454 --> 09:23.000
‎He knew that everyone here ‎would fight over his surgery,

134
09:23.084 --> 09:26.379
‎so he just chose the easiest one ‎to push around.

135
09:26.462 --> 09:28.506
‎And Dr. Do couldn't refuse.

136
09:29.882 --> 09:30.883
‎Piece of trash.

137
09:36.097 --> 09:36.931
‎"Piece of trash"?

138
09:46.982 --> 09:48.859
‎Don't make eye contact.

139
09:48.943 --> 09:49.902
‎Right.

140
09:49.985 --> 09:52.613
‎-Don't look at her. ‎-Don't look.

141
09:53.531 --> 09:54.657
‎Feels like she won.

142
09:57.702 --> 10:00.246
‎The surgical staff room ‎used to feel like home,

143
10:00.329 --> 10:01.747
‎but now it's too uncomfortable.

144
10:02.248 --> 10:04.667
‎Let's use the partition here to hide her.

145
10:06.544 --> 10:07.753
‎-Want to put it up? ‎-Yes.

146
10:07.837 --> 10:09.088
‎Yeah, good idea.

147
10:19.348 --> 10:22.518
‎-Not seeing her makes me anxious. ‎-I can't tell what she's doing.

148
10:22.601 --> 10:23.811
‎-Should we put it away? ‎-Should we?

149
10:23.894 --> 10:24.937
‎-Put it away. ‎-Yes.

150
10:25.563 --> 10:26.439
‎Lift it.

151
10:28.524 --> 10:29.942
‎Put it away.

152
10:35.823 --> 10:37.867
‎-Seeing her makes me uncomfortable. ‎-Darn it.

153
10:38.784 --> 10:40.619
‎I'm uncomfortable when I see her, ‎anxious when I don't.

154
10:40.703 --> 10:42.371
‎She gets on my nerves.

155
10:44.707 --> 10:46.250
‎-Hello, Dr. Do. ‎-Hello.

156
10:53.215 --> 10:55.050
‎Put that over there.

157
10:56.010 --> 10:56.886
‎What?

158
10:56.969 --> 10:58.596
‎I mean, yes, sir.

159
11:06.937 --> 11:08.939
‎You came to work, Dr. Gye.

160
11:09.940 --> 11:11.776
‎No, people walk through here.

161
11:11.859 --> 11:13.819
‎I didn't tell you to put it there. ‎Move it up.

162
11:14.695 --> 11:15.696
‎What?

163
11:15.780 --> 11:17.198
‎Put it on the desk.

164
11:17.781 --> 11:20.493
‎But Dr. Gye's desk is…

165
11:20.576 --> 11:21.702
‎Let's do this, intern.

166
11:37.927 --> 11:38.761
‎What's this?

167
11:39.345 --> 11:40.262
‎My employment terms.

168
11:40.846 --> 11:43.432
‎"Joining director rounds, ‎attending rounds, and work dinners."

169
11:43.516 --> 11:44.934
‎I don't do that.

170
11:45.017 --> 11:47.520
‎"Writing papers for attendings ‎and compiling data."

171
11:47.603 --> 11:48.604
‎I don't do those either.

172
11:50.856 --> 11:51.899
‎I know.

173
11:52.525 --> 11:55.027
‎I didn't bring the files here ‎for you to prep my paper.

174
11:55.569 --> 11:57.446
‎I just pulled whatever might be useful.

175
11:57.530 --> 11:59.114
‎You can take a look if you want.

176
11:59.657 --> 12:00.491
‎But…

177
12:03.494 --> 12:05.704
‎I'm afraid ‎there's nowhere else to put them.

178
12:07.206 --> 12:09.667
‎This room is just so small.

179
12:12.670 --> 12:14.463
‎I'll take some and put them on my desk.

180
12:14.547 --> 12:16.757
‎-It'll be easier for Dr. Gye… ‎-Hey, Park Tae-gyeong.

181
12:18.634 --> 12:20.803
‎-Hey, Dr. Park. ‎-Dr. Gye?

182
12:20.886 --> 12:23.347
‎Does she even have anywhere else to go?

183
12:23.430 --> 12:24.807
‎-Nice. ‎-Dr. Park.

184
12:25.766 --> 12:27.851
‎So, how's life as an intern these days…

185
12:27.935 --> 12:29.895
‎From now on, you're Gye Su-jeong's CCTV.

186
12:29.979 --> 12:30.980
‎What?

187
12:31.063 --> 12:32.773
‎Keep an eye on Dr. Gye.

188
12:32.856 --> 12:35.025
‎But I'm an intern, sir.

189
12:35.109 --> 12:36.360
‎I have to study.

190
12:36.443 --> 12:40.197
‎I assisted multiple attendings ‎while doing my studies.

191
12:40.281 --> 12:41.699
‎You just need to watch one mad dog.

192
12:41.782 --> 12:43.450
‎-"Mad dog"? ‎-Yeah.

193
12:43.534 --> 12:45.661
‎After that last surgery, ‎we're calling her a mad dog.

194
12:45.744 --> 12:48.080
‎Not "mad doc." It's "mad dog."

195
12:48.163 --> 12:49.290
‎That's what we decided.

196
12:49.373 --> 12:51.375
‎That seems pretty harsh.

197
12:51.458 --> 12:53.377
‎It's not nice to call people names.

198
12:54.295 --> 12:56.338
‎How would you feel ‎if people called you "Ma Fork-gyu"?

199
12:56.422 --> 12:57.590
‎What did you just say?

200
12:57.673 --> 12:59.800
‎Oh, the CCTV power is on now.

201
12:59.883 --> 13:01.385
‎"Fork-you"?

202
13:20.904 --> 13:21.947
‎Goodness.

203
13:23.449 --> 13:25.117
‎I've been looking all over for you.

204
13:26.118 --> 13:28.329
‎Are you going to work from here? ‎Then let's go in.

205
13:30.205 --> 13:31.707
‎Oh, you left your bag in the staff room.

206
13:31.790 --> 13:33.459
‎I have my wallet. It's my treat…

207
13:39.548 --> 13:41.967
‎Strawberry cake, ‎Earl Grey pound cake, a croffle combo,

208
13:42.051 --> 13:43.719
‎and one large, sweet vanilla latte.

209
13:44.553 --> 13:45.638
‎Bring her here.

210
13:45.721 --> 13:47.723
‎Bring that mad dog right now.

211
13:47.806 --> 13:49.558
‎It seems it was such an emergency

212
13:50.100 --> 13:51.310
‎that she wasn't thinking.

213
13:52.478 --> 13:53.312
‎Hey.

214
13:54.063 --> 13:56.440
‎Mr. New-Director, listen up.

215
13:56.523 --> 13:58.859
‎If I die, a lot of people will--

216
13:58.942 --> 14:00.944
‎Will be so sad and upset, of course.

217
14:01.028 --> 14:01.904
‎They'll have it easy.

218
14:02.780 --> 14:05.491
‎They'll be very happy ‎to blame me for everything.

219
14:06.158 --> 14:09.578
‎They'll dump the mess they made ‎right into my grave.

220
14:10.579 --> 14:11.455
‎Which is why

221
14:12.289 --> 14:14.416
‎you need to save my life.

222
14:15.000 --> 14:17.544
‎Do whatever it takes to save me, got it?

223
14:19.129 --> 14:20.464
‎Answer me!

224
14:21.048 --> 14:22.341
‎-Yes, sir. ‎-Yes, sir.

225
14:25.344 --> 14:27.012
‎It's nice to see you enjoy your food.

226
14:27.096 --> 14:28.931
‎Oh, you probably need your bag…

227
14:30.557 --> 14:32.643
‎You had your wallet? Then why didn't you…

228
14:32.726 --> 14:33.602
‎I'm broke.

229
14:34.186 --> 14:35.312
‎Why are you broke?

230
14:40.484 --> 14:43.320
‎"Employment terms. ‎No personal talk whatsoever."

231
14:47.324 --> 14:49.326
‎What if I get you some blueberry cake--

232
14:49.410 --> 14:50.327
‎I spent my allowance.

233
14:51.078 --> 14:53.247
‎You get an allowance? From whom?

234
14:53.330 --> 14:54.581
‎-Ms. Jang at the agency. ‎-I see.

235
14:54.665 --> 14:56.417
‎So she manages your money.

236
14:56.500 --> 14:57.835
‎Do you live together?

237
14:57.918 --> 14:59.878
‎But your salary isn't peanuts ‎like some kid's allowance.

238
14:59.962 --> 15:01.046
‎How much do you get?

239
15:06.176 --> 15:07.386
‎A hundred thousand won.

240
15:07.469 --> 15:09.388
‎A hundred thousand won per day is plenty.

241
15:09.471 --> 15:10.723
‎-Per month. ‎-What?

242
15:10.806 --> 15:13.434
‎That's insane. ‎Does she have something on you?

243
15:21.734 --> 15:23.027
‎I'm in debt.

244
15:23.110 --> 15:25.195
‎What? Is it a lot?

245
15:25.279 --> 15:27.573
‎Yeah. I get in trouble if I don't listen.

246
15:27.656 --> 15:28.782
‎Trouble?

247
15:28.866 --> 15:31.368
‎What do you mean? ‎Does she hit you or something?

248
15:31.452 --> 15:33.120
‎Yeah. She hits me.

249
15:33.829 --> 15:35.706
‎She hit me yesterday ‎because I spent my allowance.

250
15:36.749 --> 15:38.292
‎By any chance,

251
15:38.375 --> 15:41.211
‎did this Ms. Jang ‎take your passport or ID?

252
15:41.295 --> 15:43.297
‎Yeah. She takes care of all that.

253
15:52.723 --> 15:55.601
‎Su-jeong likes cake

254
15:56.310 --> 15:58.562
‎Su-jeong, here's some tasty cake.

255
15:59.188 --> 16:00.189
‎Cake!

256
16:00.272 --> 16:02.900
‎If you want it, go to work and make money.

257
16:02.983 --> 16:04.443
‎You doctor-slave.

258
16:04.526 --> 16:05.861
‎Put your hands up!

259
16:08.739 --> 16:09.573
‎I need your signature.

260
16:10.532 --> 16:12.201
‎I took out a loan under your name.

261
16:21.418 --> 16:22.586
‎I want more of this.

262
16:23.545 --> 16:24.463
‎Of course.

263
16:24.546 --> 16:26.048
‎I can buy however much you want.

264
16:26.131 --> 16:27.925
‎I have a lot of money.

265
16:28.008 --> 16:29.259
‎Eat as much as you want.

266
16:30.636 --> 16:31.887
‎You're a good person.

267
16:33.180 --> 16:34.306
‎Until I finish this, that is.

268
16:35.432 --> 16:36.809
‎Do you crave anything these days?

269
16:37.434 --> 16:39.645
‎-Jjajangmyeon. ‎-I'll treat you someday.

270
16:39.728 --> 16:40.604
‎Treat me today.

271
16:40.687 --> 16:42.272
‎When do you get off? I leave at six.

272
16:42.356 --> 16:44.191
‎But I don't. Come on, you know that.

273
16:44.274 --> 16:45.275
‎Get off work with me.

274
16:56.703 --> 16:58.330
‎I'm sure kiosks aren't easy

275
16:58.413 --> 17:01.291
‎for patients or elderly people, ‎even with a kiosk attendant.

276
17:01.375 --> 17:03.919
‎I'm still young, but you saw ‎how much trouble I had too.

277
17:04.419 --> 17:06.380
‎It's hard to read, you get nervous…

278
17:06.463 --> 17:08.173
‎And you worry about the people behind you.

279
17:08.257 --> 17:11.510
‎-Right. Then you freeze up even more. ‎-Excuse me.

280
17:11.593 --> 17:14.054
‎And it makes you think you're incompetent.

281
17:15.139 --> 17:16.056
‎May I help you?

282
17:16.140 --> 17:17.266
‎Yes, please.

283
17:18.016 --> 17:18.892
‎Thank you.

284
17:19.726 --> 17:22.020
‎Still, it's there to help people.

285
17:22.104 --> 17:23.730
‎It's there to help the hospital.

286
17:24.565 --> 17:26.316
‎Does that look like it helps people?

287
17:28.152 --> 17:31.029
‎I didn't think ‎you'd notice things like that.

288
17:34.241 --> 17:37.244
‎Try not to think too much ‎about what happened in the staff room.

289
17:37.327 --> 17:38.328
‎What?

290
17:39.163 --> 17:40.372
‎Getting kicked out…

291
17:40.455 --> 17:41.707
‎You know, getting bullied.

292
17:44.710 --> 17:45.627
‎I had no idea.

293
17:48.005 --> 17:50.591
‎Anyway, try to ‎keep a low profile for a bit.

294
17:56.930 --> 17:57.931
‎Yeong-seon.

295
17:58.015 --> 18:00.559
‎-I would've done this for you. ‎-There you are.

296
18:00.642 --> 18:02.436
‎I was trying out the kiosk myself.

297
18:03.187 --> 18:04.521
‎How's Ju-hui?

298
18:05.105 --> 18:07.774
‎-The pain went away, but now she's mad. ‎-Right.

299
18:07.858 --> 18:08.775
‎Why is she mad?

300
18:09.401 --> 18:10.277
‎I can't blame her.

301
18:11.111 --> 18:13.197
‎She's been sick all her life, ‎and now she has cancer.

302
18:13.989 --> 18:14.823
‎Of all things…

303
18:14.907 --> 18:17.034
‎-Insert your credit card. ‎-Your card, please.

304
18:18.202 --> 18:19.328
‎They want an interim payment.

305
18:21.455 --> 18:23.081
‎Like we'd skip out on the bill.

306
18:24.666 --> 18:25.751
‎Hold on.

307
18:26.376 --> 18:28.503
‎Hey, that over there.

308
18:28.587 --> 18:29.755
‎What's that vest doing in here?

309
18:29.838 --> 18:30.923
‎Get rid of that.

310
18:31.632 --> 18:32.466
‎Get rid of it now.

311
18:33.634 --> 18:35.093
‎-It's kind of amazing. ‎-You need to leave.

312
18:35.177 --> 18:36.553
‎-What? ‎-Who are you?

313
18:36.637 --> 18:37.888
‎-What on earth? ‎-What's going on?

314
18:37.971 --> 18:39.014
‎What are you doing?

315
18:40.015 --> 18:42.059
‎-Oh, are you scared? ‎-Yeong-ju, no.

316
18:42.142 --> 18:43.435
‎Is that why you're doing this?

317
18:45.354 --> 18:46.313
‎What are you doing?

318
18:47.314 --> 18:48.607
‎-Give it back! ‎-Wait.

319
18:48.690 --> 18:51.235
‎She's with me. She's not here to protest.

320
18:51.318 --> 18:52.736
‎-What are you doing? ‎-Yeong-ju!

321
18:52.819 --> 18:54.821
‎-Don't push her wheelchair! ‎-Look.

322
18:54.905 --> 18:55.906
‎-She's with me. ‎-Let go.

323
18:55.989 --> 18:58.617
‎Take your hands off her! ‎What's wrong with you?

324
18:58.700 --> 19:01.203
‎-I'm her caregiver. ‎-Hey, it's that nutjob.

325
19:01.286 --> 19:02.246
‎You said she'd be gone.

326
19:02.329 --> 19:04.873
‎-Why is she still here? ‎-I'm my sister and niece's caregiver!

327
19:04.957 --> 19:07.251
‎-Will you please… ‎-Excuse me!

328
19:07.334 --> 19:08.919
‎Your card's maxed out.

329
19:09.002 --> 19:10.837
‎My credit card…

330
19:10.921 --> 19:14.299
‎My wallet is in that vest. ‎Can you give it to my sister?

331
19:15.175 --> 19:17.052
‎I said let go. Are you insane?

332
19:17.552 --> 19:19.888
‎-Come on. ‎-What's the matter with you?

333
19:19.972 --> 19:22.683
‎-Let go of me! ‎-Use your words, okay?

334
19:22.766 --> 19:25.352
‎-Are you insane? ‎-Just let her go first, okay?

335
19:25.435 --> 19:26.728
‎Why are you doing this?

336
19:26.812 --> 19:28.814
‎The less they have, the louder they shout.

337
19:29.356 --> 19:31.608
‎Look at those pathetic losers.

338
19:31.692 --> 19:33.318
‎-Sir… ‎-"Pathetic"?

339
19:33.902 --> 19:34.987
‎Pathetic?

340
19:35.487 --> 19:37.614
‎And whose fault is this?

341
19:37.698 --> 19:39.574
‎Give my aunt her paycheck!

342
19:39.658 --> 19:41.159
‎Give it to her!

343
19:41.243 --> 19:43.578
‎-Ju-hui! ‎-Pay my aunt right now!

344
19:43.662 --> 19:44.705
‎Ju-hui!

345
19:44.788 --> 19:47.124
‎-Ju-hui, stop. ‎-Pay her!

346
19:47.207 --> 19:48.709
‎-Careful! ‎-Ju-hui!

347
19:48.792 --> 19:51.962
‎-Has she lost her mind? ‎-What the hell are you doing?

348
19:52.045 --> 19:52.921
‎Ju-hui!

349
19:53.005 --> 19:54.464
‎-Come on, guys. ‎-Push!

350
19:54.548 --> 19:55.549
‎-Stop it! ‎-Ju-hui!

351
19:56.300 --> 19:58.010
‎-Allow me to push you. ‎-You'll hurt yourself.

352
19:58.093 --> 19:59.177
‎-Please stop. ‎-Ju-hui, stop!

353
19:59.261 --> 20:01.221
‎Please let go of her. You'll hurt her.

354
20:01.305 --> 20:04.266
‎-Please let her go. ‎-Let go of her!

355
20:04.349 --> 20:05.892
‎Wait a minute!

356
20:07.352 --> 20:09.062
‎What do you think you're doing?

357
20:09.146 --> 20:10.230
‎Is that blood?

358
20:10.314 --> 20:11.606
‎Is she bleeding?

359
20:11.690 --> 20:13.859
‎-She's bleeding. ‎-Let me take a look.

360
20:14.943 --> 20:16.611
‎Let go of me now!

361
20:18.196 --> 20:19.239
‎Ju-hui.

362
20:20.824 --> 20:22.117
‎-Ju-hui. ‎-Oh god.

363
20:23.577 --> 20:24.578
‎Are you okay?

364
20:27.581 --> 20:29.833
‎-Where did the chairman go? ‎-Ju-hui, are you okay?

365
20:29.916 --> 20:31.793
‎-Where is he? ‎-Ju-hui.

366
20:31.877 --> 20:33.462
‎-Ju-hui. ‎-You're bleeding.

367
20:43.889 --> 20:44.806
‎He's right.

368
20:46.725 --> 20:48.060
‎We're pathetic.

369
20:49.478 --> 20:50.312
‎Hey.

370
20:51.063 --> 20:52.189
‎Lee Ju-hui.

371
20:52.272 --> 20:53.357
‎Lee Ju-hui!

372
20:55.359 --> 20:56.234
‎Ju-hui.

373
20:56.943 --> 20:57.778
‎Ju-hui.

374
20:58.737 --> 21:00.113
‎-Ju-hui. ‎-What on earth?

375
21:00.739 --> 21:01.823
‎What's this blood?

376
21:01.907 --> 21:02.741
‎You scared me.

377
21:03.742 --> 21:05.577
‎You're back already? Where's the chairman?

378
21:06.870 --> 21:07.704
‎I parked him.

379
21:13.168 --> 21:14.628
‎Hey!

380
21:15.379 --> 21:19.299
‎Hey!

381
21:27.432 --> 21:31.061
‎Your sister will join ‎after a quick talk with the hospital.

382
21:31.144 --> 21:31.978
‎Okay.

383
21:32.062 --> 21:34.022
‎I want you to leave when she comes.

384
21:34.106 --> 21:36.149
‎Why? I need to be here.

385
21:37.234 --> 21:38.777
‎Two balls and one strike.

386
21:38.860 --> 21:40.278
‎Here comes pitch number four.

387
21:40.362 --> 21:42.823
‎Right down the middle, strike!

388
21:42.906 --> 21:44.408
‎Two-and-two count.

389
21:45.784 --> 21:47.911
‎Ma'am, can we step outside

390
21:47.994 --> 21:50.163
‎and talk about the patient's surgery?

391
21:50.831 --> 21:51.998
‎Sure.

392
21:52.082 --> 21:54.084
‎Talk to her when my aunt comes.

393
21:57.003 --> 21:58.672
‎Just a minute, Doctor.

394
22:03.260 --> 22:04.302
‎Here.

395
22:04.886 --> 22:05.887
‎Thank you.

396
22:07.889 --> 22:08.890
‎Dr. Gye.

397
22:25.615 --> 22:28.118
‎Type 1 diabetes and a pancreatoblastoma.

398
22:28.201 --> 22:29.161
‎That's a rare case.

399
22:29.244 --> 22:31.621
‎Really? Is it that serious?

400
22:32.622 --> 22:34.958
‎-It's a disaster. ‎-It's a disaster?

401
22:35.041 --> 22:37.210
‎How did he miss the ball? ‎This inning is a disaster.

402
22:40.172 --> 22:41.798
‎You're a rare case too.

403
22:45.302 --> 22:46.136
‎Excuse me.

404
22:50.557 --> 22:52.475
‎A base hit through the left side!

405
22:53.018 --> 22:56.521
‎Riding back-to-back hits ‎to build some momentum…

406
22:56.605 --> 22:57.439
‎Where are you going?

407
22:58.732 --> 22:59.649
‎Dr. Gye!

408
23:00.233 --> 23:02.485
‎What is it? What about Dr. Gye?

409
23:02.569 --> 23:03.403
‎She disappeared.

410
23:03.486 --> 23:05.197
‎She disappeared? Where to?

411
23:08.825 --> 23:09.659
‎Yes, Doctor.

412
23:09.743 --> 23:11.453
‎Oh, Dr. Gye…

413
23:12.704 --> 23:14.414
‎What? She got into trouble?

414
23:15.248 --> 23:17.000
‎When did this happen?

415
23:18.376 --> 23:20.378
‎But she just disappeared.

416
23:32.849 --> 23:36.436
‎-Dr. Gye… ‎-Where's Dr. Gye? I want to see her face.

417
23:36.519 --> 23:38.146
‎-I know she's here. ‎-Is that her?

418
23:38.230 --> 23:39.105
‎There she is.

419
23:40.815 --> 23:42.484
‎Yeah, that's her. Right?

420
23:42.567 --> 23:43.985
‎-Yeah. ‎-Look at her enjoying the food.

421
23:44.069 --> 23:45.278
‎Dr. Gye.

422
23:48.365 --> 23:49.824
‎-Dr. Gye! ‎-What's going on?

423
23:50.325 --> 23:51.326
‎What's wrong?

424
23:52.035 --> 23:53.036
‎Dr. Gye.

425
23:53.119 --> 23:56.122
‎What were you doing ‎before we went to the café?

426
24:00.168 --> 24:01.086
‎I was in the hallway.

427
24:01.169 --> 24:02.254
‎What were you doing there?

428
24:02.337 --> 24:04.297
‎I saw a dizzy patient lying there,

429
24:04.381 --> 24:07.008
‎so I asked her a few questions ‎and sent her to ENT.

430
24:07.092 --> 24:07.926
‎She had Ménière's.

431
24:08.009 --> 24:11.554
‎What does a temporary worker like you ‎know about Ménière's?

432
24:11.638 --> 24:13.431
‎Lower your voice, please.

433
24:13.515 --> 24:15.350
‎You're actually getting upset over that?

434
24:15.433 --> 24:18.645
‎That patient was waiting ‎for her IM appointment.

435
24:18.728 --> 24:21.064
‎But now she's lying on a couch in ENT.

436
24:22.107 --> 24:23.566
‎-Did they run the tests? ‎-We sure did.

437
24:24.401 --> 24:26.736
‎She can't hear low frequencies, ‎and she has nystagmus.

438
24:26.820 --> 24:27.904
‎It's Ménière's.

439
24:28.488 --> 24:29.656
‎Problem solved.

440
24:29.739 --> 24:31.783
‎That's not the issue!

441
24:31.866 --> 24:34.995
‎The issue is that she meddled ‎in another department's case.

442
24:36.037 --> 24:38.957
‎She went from one small-town clinic ‎to another for years

443
24:39.040 --> 24:42.127
‎where they brushed it off as old age ‎and gave her fluids or strong meds.

444
24:42.210 --> 24:45.297
‎Her child finally brought her ‎to a big hospital in the city,

445
24:45.380 --> 24:46.464
‎so why send her in circles?

446
24:47.090 --> 24:49.050
‎Even her child dismissed her symptoms,

447
24:49.134 --> 24:50.844
‎saying it was late-life depression.

448
24:50.927 --> 24:54.139
‎It's true. ‎That's why she held onto me and cried.

449
24:54.222 --> 24:56.683
‎It's the first time anyone ‎gave her a clear diagnosis.

450
24:56.766 --> 24:57.976
‎She wept as she thanked me.

451
24:58.059 --> 24:59.436
‎I was so embarrassed.

452
25:00.061 --> 25:02.480
‎But wait, did she speak to me informally?

453
25:02.564 --> 25:04.107
‎-Yes. ‎-Yeah.

454
25:04.190 --> 25:06.526
‎You're obnoxiously rude, ‎just like the rumors say.

455
25:07.027 --> 25:08.111
‎How fascinating.

456
25:08.194 --> 25:11.031
‎How dare a butcher diagnose patients?

457
25:11.114 --> 25:14.034
‎"How dare a butcher diagnose patients?"

458
25:14.701 --> 25:16.578
‎-You'd better watch it. ‎-What?

459
25:17.078 --> 25:20.498
‎How would you feel if a temping internist ‎stole a surgical patient?

460
25:20.582 --> 25:21.458
‎Let's calm down.

461
25:21.541 --> 25:23.543
‎This isn't a fight between IM and surgery.

462
25:23.626 --> 25:27.005
‎The problem is that Dr. Gye here ‎keeps crossing the line,

463
25:27.088 --> 25:28.381
‎so we should focus on…

464
25:28.465 --> 25:30.216
‎All right. Just apologize.

465
25:30.300 --> 25:32.260
‎Oh, I don't need an apology.

466
25:32.344 --> 25:33.762
‎I just came ‎to put a face to a name.

467
25:33.845 --> 25:35.555
‎I was curious about ‎the notorious Gye-snake.

468
25:37.891 --> 25:39.059
‎See you around.

469
25:40.310 --> 25:41.478
‎You're pretty interesting.

470
25:41.561 --> 25:42.437
‎See you guys.

471
25:43.021 --> 25:44.856
‎I need more than an apology.

472
25:44.939 --> 25:47.233
‎I want to see disciplinary action ‎and a pay cut.

473
25:47.317 --> 25:49.944
‎None of that applies to me ‎since I'm a temporary worker.

474
25:50.528 --> 25:51.905
‎How dare you keep…

475
25:51.988 --> 25:54.240
‎She keeps talking back,

476
25:54.324 --> 25:56.826
‎but she's not wrong, ‎so you can't argue with her.

477
25:56.910 --> 25:58.745
‎I get it. Just leave for now.

478
25:58.828 --> 26:01.206
‎We'll handle things internally

479
26:01.289 --> 26:02.374
‎and give you an update.

480
26:02.457 --> 26:03.708
‎You need to set her straight.

481
26:04.376 --> 26:05.627
‎I won't let this slide.

482
26:05.710 --> 26:06.669
‎Okay.

483
26:07.170 --> 26:08.546
‎Jeez, I'm getting heartburn.

484
26:08.630 --> 26:10.298
‎He's so damn loud.

485
26:11.007 --> 26:12.967
‎He really does have a nasty temper.

486
26:13.051 --> 26:14.427
‎He'll be on antacids forever.

487
26:14.511 --> 26:18.056
‎Why would you do that in the hallway?

488
26:19.015 --> 26:19.891
‎Pork cutlet.

489
26:21.184 --> 26:23.728
‎-Can I go back for more? It's good. ‎-What?

490
26:23.812 --> 26:27.232
‎-Dr. Gye, please read the room. ‎-This place is a hidden gem…

491
26:27.315 --> 26:29.484
‎-I'll get you some more in a bit. ‎-I…

492
26:30.068 --> 26:32.153
‎Look…

493
26:32.237 --> 26:33.822
‎Park Tae-gyeong, where were you?

494
26:34.406 --> 26:37.242
‎I'm sorry. I had no idea ‎she'd done that in that short time.

495
26:37.867 --> 26:40.787
‎But I don't think ‎Dr. Gye did anything bad--

496
26:40.870 --> 26:42.205
‎Right, it wasn't bad.

497
26:42.288 --> 26:44.082
‎But she did cross the line.

498
26:45.208 --> 26:46.167
‎On purpose too.

499
26:46.251 --> 26:47.502
‎What do you mean?

500
26:47.585 --> 26:49.254
‎To get back to the surgical staff room.

501
26:49.337 --> 26:51.548
‎She's getting in trouble ‎to get her desk back.

502
26:53.091 --> 26:55.009
‎Are you saying you kicked her out?

503
26:55.844 --> 26:57.595
‎You're not kids. ‎What's the matter with you?

504
26:57.679 --> 26:58.930
‎You're right.

505
26:59.013 --> 27:02.183
‎Dr. Gye is really meticulous, isn't she?

506
27:02.267 --> 27:03.184
‎That's what I'm saying.

507
27:03.268 --> 27:05.562
‎Is that what you really think?

508
27:05.645 --> 27:06.646
‎Look at her.

509
27:07.981 --> 27:09.732
‎She's disguising herself

510
27:09.816 --> 27:12.527
‎by messing up her hair ‎for a few more slices of pork cutlet.

511
27:12.610 --> 27:13.778
‎You call her meticulous?

512
27:20.743 --> 27:24.205
‎Our first patient is ‎Park Gwang-cheol, 67 years old.

513
27:24.289 --> 27:27.125
‎He's a VIP who has supported ‎the hospital over the years.

514
27:27.208 --> 27:30.837
‎We should make sure ‎he's comfortable during his stay here.

515
27:31.379 --> 27:34.132
‎The primary surgeon for this case ‎is Dr. Do Yun-sik.

516
27:34.215 --> 27:36.801
‎That man is a VIP?

517
27:37.302 --> 27:40.138
‎The diagnosis is pancreatic cancer ‎in the head of the pancreas,

518
27:40.221 --> 27:41.806
‎measuring 4 cm.

519
27:42.307 --> 27:45.101
‎We'll proceed with the Whipple procedure.

520
27:45.185 --> 27:46.686
‎-I'll do my best-- ‎-Objection.

521
27:50.398 --> 27:53.443
‎There's a possibility the cancer ‎has invaded the SMA or SMV.

522
27:53.526 --> 27:55.570
‎That won't change anything.

523
27:55.653 --> 27:57.780
‎The VIP refuses chemotherapy.

524
27:58.907 --> 28:00.116
‎We'll perform the surgery

525
28:00.200 --> 28:02.619
‎while preserving the SMA ‎as much as possible.

526
28:02.702 --> 28:04.370
‎Along with the tumor? ‎Then it's an R2 resection.

527
28:04.454 --> 28:05.747
‎What's the point of surgery then?

528
28:05.830 --> 28:08.166
‎He's doing chemo after the surgery.

529
28:08.249 --> 28:11.377
‎Let's resect it along with the vessel ‎and do an R0 resection.

530
28:14.172 --> 28:15.757
‎Are you kidding me?

531
28:17.926 --> 28:19.385
‎An R0 resection?

532
28:19.469 --> 28:21.387
‎You think we haven't thought of that?

533
28:21.471 --> 28:22.764
‎Are you trying to get us screwed?

534
28:22.847 --> 28:26.518
‎Every surgeon knows ‎not to mess with the SMA.

535
28:26.601 --> 28:27.435
‎Or maybe you don't.

536
28:30.188 --> 28:31.731
‎I'm okay with messing with it,

537
28:31.814 --> 28:34.192
‎but I guess you're not.

538
28:37.362 --> 28:38.780
‎Are you saying you can do it?

539
28:39.531 --> 28:41.824
‎-Yes. ‎-You'll do it yourself?

540
28:42.700 --> 28:44.994
‎-If you fail, you'll have to-- ‎-I…

541
28:47.288 --> 28:48.706
‎don't fail.

542
28:55.880 --> 28:59.092
‎Our next patient is Lee Ju-hui, ‎a 15-year-old female.

543
28:59.175 --> 29:01.135
‎She is Dr. Do Yun-sik's patient.

544
29:01.219 --> 29:03.972
‎Due to the VIP's request ‎to move his surgery up,

545
29:04.055 --> 29:06.724
‎Ms. Lee Ju-hui's surgery ‎has been rescheduled with her consent.

546
29:06.808 --> 29:09.227
‎Ms. Lee Ju-hui's surgery…

547
29:10.979 --> 29:12.605
‎will be performed by Dr. Gye.

548
29:14.274 --> 29:15.441
‎Director Bu.

549
29:15.525 --> 29:17.944
‎She's a very important patient ‎for my case report.

550
29:18.653 --> 29:20.405
‎-I don't approve. ‎-I don't approve either.

551
29:20.989 --> 29:23.116
‎You think it's acceptable ‎to delay a surgery?

552
29:23.199 --> 29:24.033
‎Continue.

553
29:25.076 --> 29:26.160
‎Yes, sir.

554
29:26.244 --> 29:28.746
‎There's an 8 cm tumor ‎in the body and tail of the pancreas.

555
29:29.414 --> 29:32.375
‎The imaging scan recommended ‎checking for pancreatoblastoma,

556
29:32.458 --> 29:35.086
‎so we performed ‎an endoscopic ultrasound-guided biopsy,

557
29:35.169 --> 29:36.504
‎confirming the diagnosis.

558
29:36.588 --> 29:40.008
‎Fortunately, there was no evidence ‎of distant metastasis.

559
29:53.104 --> 29:54.022
‎There.

560
29:57.025 --> 29:59.110
‎Don't get into trouble, ‎or you'll get fired.

561
29:59.777 --> 30:01.279
‎Keep to yourself for a bit.

562
30:01.779 --> 30:03.072
‎You still get to operate.

563
30:03.156 --> 30:05.158
‎Considering Su-jeong's personality,

564
30:05.241 --> 30:06.075
‎you think she can do that?

565
30:08.453 --> 30:10.538
‎Man, that was a narrow escape.

566
30:12.749 --> 30:14.918
‎If Dr. Do operates,

567
30:16.044 --> 30:17.545
‎the patient could die.

568
30:18.922 --> 30:20.256
‎Now that's how you do it.

569
30:21.466 --> 30:22.675
‎He's that bad?

570
30:22.759 --> 30:24.969
‎He got his position ‎through papers, research, and politics,

571
30:25.053 --> 30:26.220
‎not with his surgical skills.

572
30:27.263 --> 30:29.182
‎That world hospital doctors live in?

573
30:30.767 --> 30:31.601
‎Face,

574
30:32.143 --> 30:33.394
‎prestige,

575
30:33.478 --> 30:34.395
‎and authority.

576
30:35.229 --> 30:37.482
‎These things hold it together.

577
30:37.565 --> 30:40.109
‎Without them, they're not doctors.

578
30:40.193 --> 30:42.946
‎If that's the case, ‎they weren't real doctors to begin with.

579
30:43.821 --> 30:44.989
‎And when those things…

580
30:47.492 --> 30:48.701
‎suddenly disappear,

581
30:48.785 --> 30:50.328
‎that's when we go in.

582
30:51.913 --> 30:53.498
‎Oh, darn it.

583
30:56.334 --> 30:57.585
‎-Face down. ‎-Oh, right.

584
30:58.211 --> 30:59.671
‎This is what you get for losing.

585
31:00.171 --> 31:02.882
‎How can someone be so blinded by ambition?

586
31:03.675 --> 31:05.259
‎Ms. Lee Ju-hui is a patient too.

587
31:06.427 --> 31:08.888
‎Do you get paid more for VIP surgeries?

588
31:09.555 --> 31:10.848
‎Keep an eye on her tomorrow.

589
31:11.349 --> 31:12.976
‎And tell her to apologize to IM.

590
31:14.143 --> 31:15.144
‎See you.

591
31:15.645 --> 31:17.522
‎-Have a good night, sir. ‎-Thanks.

592
31:30.159 --> 31:32.495
‎Dr. Gye might come back here tomorrow, so…

593
31:44.298 --> 31:47.969
‎Complications can include ‎pancreatic fistula, peritonitis,

594
31:48.052 --> 31:51.305
‎infections, blood clots, ‎pulmonary and cardiac complications,

595
31:51.389 --> 31:54.434
‎bowel obstruction, ‎and postoperative bleeding.

596
31:55.184 --> 31:56.477
‎Do you have any questions?

597
31:57.437 --> 31:59.605
‎Why did the doctor change?

598
31:59.689 --> 32:02.316
‎I thought he was a senior physician, ‎but she's…

599
32:03.026 --> 32:05.194
‎She's very good too. I guarantee it.

600
32:05.778 --> 32:06.779
‎Seriously?

601
32:06.863 --> 32:09.824
‎He went on about ‎how I was such a rare case

602
32:10.408 --> 32:12.243
‎and insisted on doing it.

603
32:12.326 --> 32:13.453
‎What a joke.

604
32:14.912 --> 32:16.956
‎How long will the surgery take?

605
32:17.999 --> 32:20.543
‎We estimate around three to four hours.

606
32:21.878 --> 32:23.796
‎-It's so long. ‎-Yeah.

607
32:25.715 --> 32:27.133
‎Can I just not do the surgery?

608
32:28.885 --> 32:29.761
‎What?

609
32:29.844 --> 32:31.637
‎-What did you just say? ‎-Are you insane?

610
32:32.305 --> 32:33.306
‎Hey.

611
32:33.389 --> 32:36.225
‎Your mom and I cashed out ‎your college fund.

612
32:36.309 --> 32:38.227
‎You need to focus on ‎recovering after the surgery.

613
32:38.311 --> 32:39.896
‎Let's be real.

614
32:40.438 --> 32:42.315
‎Even if I live, I won't get into college.

615
32:43.232 --> 32:45.276
‎So hit the books.

616
32:45.359 --> 32:46.569
‎I looked it up.

617
32:46.652 --> 32:49.739
‎The prognosis or whatever ‎wasn't very good.

618
32:50.698 --> 32:53.076
‎In my condition, ‎I'm pretty much done for, right?

619
32:53.159 --> 32:54.077
‎Hey.

620
32:54.577 --> 32:57.580
‎That damn internet ‎is messing with you kids' heads.

621
32:58.372 --> 33:00.083
‎Don't listen to her.

622
33:00.166 --> 33:01.709
‎This doctor can do the surgery.

623
33:01.793 --> 33:03.711
‎Ms. Lee, you need this surgery--

624
33:03.795 --> 33:04.796
‎How…

625
33:05.797 --> 33:08.925
‎-How could you say that in front of me? ‎-Stop it, both of you.

626
33:09.008 --> 33:09.842
‎Let me see the form.

627
33:09.926 --> 33:13.012
‎We'll sign it now ‎and go outside to bicker.

628
33:13.096 --> 33:14.847
‎Ms. Lee, please don't do that!

629
33:14.931 --> 33:15.807
‎-Ju-hui! ‎-Let's stop.

630
33:15.890 --> 33:18.017
‎-Hey! ‎-I'm sick of this!

631
33:19.185 --> 33:20.228
‎I've had enough, okay?

632
33:20.311 --> 33:23.523
‎Look, I'm 15 years old.

633
33:24.524 --> 33:25.983
‎You know what the kids say?

634
33:26.818 --> 33:28.486
‎They call me a junkie

635
33:28.569 --> 33:31.114
‎because I give myself ‎injections in the restroom.

636
33:33.699 --> 33:36.327
‎You'll die without your insulin shots. ‎They don't know anything.

637
33:36.410 --> 33:38.663
‎But now I have cancer.

638
33:39.247 --> 33:40.832
‎Mom, you're in a wheelchair.

639
33:42.375 --> 33:44.418
‎Isn't it hard to look after me?

640
33:47.130 --> 33:48.256
‎No. I'm your mother.

641
33:48.339 --> 33:49.632
‎What about you, Aunt?

642
33:50.967 --> 33:52.969
‎Let's be honest. ‎It's been the hardest for you.

643
33:54.011 --> 33:56.848
‎Your sister is in a wheelchair, ‎and your niece has cancer.

644
33:56.931 --> 33:59.267
‎You take on twice as many ‎wallpapering jobs to support us.

645
33:59.350 --> 34:00.935
‎And you do the household chores.

646
34:01.894 --> 34:03.146
‎You don't deserve this.

647
34:03.646 --> 34:04.897
‎That's for me to deal with.

648
34:05.773 --> 34:07.733
‎You're making it harder right now. ‎Give me that.

649
34:07.817 --> 34:09.193
‎Please…

650
34:09.277 --> 34:10.403
‎Just leave me alone.

651
34:11.195 --> 34:13.990
‎Just go, all of you.

652
34:14.073 --> 34:15.867
‎Just let me die!

653
34:15.950 --> 34:17.743
‎We all die someday.

654
34:21.664 --> 34:23.457
‎So you don't have to rush things.

655
34:23.541 --> 34:25.585
‎There's no difference ‎if you die today or next week.

656
34:25.668 --> 34:28.379
‎-Dr. Gye, you shouldn't say-- ‎-It makes no difference.

657
34:29.714 --> 34:32.216
‎But without surgery, ‎you'll die within the month.

658
34:32.800 --> 34:34.802
‎Even if we operate…

659
34:34.886 --> 34:36.095
‎I guess you'll still die.

660
34:36.846 --> 34:37.722
‎In about a hundred years.

661
34:37.805 --> 34:39.473
‎She's 15, so she'd have that long, right?

662
34:40.224 --> 34:41.142
‎Well…

663
34:41.225 --> 34:43.019
‎But there's one condition.

664
34:43.728 --> 34:44.687
‎I operate on you.

665
34:45.688 --> 34:46.898
‎Because I don't fail.

666
34:47.690 --> 34:50.401
‎As long as my patient is still breathing, ‎I'll save them no matter what.

667
34:57.450 --> 34:58.326
‎You decide.

668
34:59.118 --> 35:01.746
‎Do you want to die in a month, ‎or in a hundred years?

669
35:04.123 --> 35:06.584
‎"Do you want to die in a month, ‎or in a hundred years?"

670
35:08.628 --> 35:11.047
‎What was the point of me ‎explaining all that?

671
35:11.130 --> 35:12.965
‎All it took was that one question.

672
35:14.258 --> 35:16.093
‎But if you fail, we're in serious trouble.

673
35:16.719 --> 35:18.846
‎Naturally. Someone could die.

674
35:18.930 --> 35:19.847
‎Right.

675
35:20.806 --> 35:23.351
‎Still, you've been reading that chart…

676
35:24.018 --> 35:25.144
‎What's this?

677
35:25.228 --> 35:27.396
‎Have you been reading ‎Mr. Park Gwang-cheol's chart?

678
35:27.480 --> 35:28.564
‎Dr. Gye.

679
35:32.360 --> 35:34.987
‎I'm counting on you ‎for Ms. Lee Ju-hui's surgery.

680
35:35.071 --> 35:36.822
‎I could do it, of course,

681
35:36.906 --> 35:39.408
‎but Director Bu was kind enough ‎to ease my burden.

682
35:39.492 --> 35:43.204
‎-We got the signed consent form. ‎-Are you sure you don't want to switch?

683
35:43.287 --> 35:44.413
‎Dr. Gye.

684
35:50.419 --> 35:52.338
‎At least tell me why you're saying that.

685
35:53.547 --> 35:54.840
‎You can't do it with your skills.

686
35:54.924 --> 35:56.884
‎-Hey. Why you… ‎-Sir.

687
35:57.635 --> 35:59.971
‎Too bad you aren't as good ‎as you are stubborn.

688
36:00.054 --> 36:02.640
‎We heard that. We can hear you!

689
36:02.723 --> 36:04.767
‎People can hear you. ‎Please calm down, sir.

690
36:04.850 --> 36:05.977
‎Seriously?

691
36:13.567 --> 36:14.568
‎Hold on.

692
36:15.152 --> 36:16.862
‎Su-jeong, come and eat!

693
36:19.490 --> 36:22.159
‎-She must be mapping out the surgery. ‎-Yes.

694
36:22.243 --> 36:24.704
‎She likes operating more than eating.

695
36:24.787 --> 36:25.746
‎Just one!

696
36:26.664 --> 36:27.915
‎One for each person.

697
36:32.545 --> 36:33.713
‎Why won't you go home?

698
36:33.796 --> 36:35.715
‎You're eating all three meals here.

699
36:36.507 --> 36:37.925
‎Is today a special day?

700
36:38.009 --> 36:39.552
‎-You made braised short ribs-- ‎-Hey!

701
36:40.886 --> 36:41.721
‎Have kimchi.

702
36:43.306 --> 36:46.350
‎DOCTOR DO YUN-SIK

703
36:58.321 --> 37:00.156
‎You can't do it with your skills.

704
37:01.073 --> 37:03.034
‎Ms. Lee Ju-hui's surgery

705
37:03.117 --> 37:04.994
‎will be performed by Dr. Gye.

706
37:36.901 --> 37:41.655
‎CASE 2: ABDOMINAL DISCOMFORT ‎DIAGNOSED WITH TYPE 1 DIABETES AT AGE 5

707
37:43.991 --> 37:44.909
‎Found it.

708
37:48.913 --> 37:50.956
‎GUSEO UNIVERSITY SEONAM MEDICAL CENTER

709
37:56.796 --> 37:59.131
‎Right, you have ‎the pancreatoblastoma patient today.

710
37:59.799 --> 38:01.342
‎In OR 5, right?

711
38:01.425 --> 38:02.968
‎It's not too late to switch.

712
38:18.025 --> 38:19.485
‎Let's do a time-out.

713
38:19.985 --> 38:22.071
‎Stop what you're doing and focus.

714
38:22.154 --> 38:24.615
‎Patient's name and ID number?

715
38:24.698 --> 38:26.909
‎It's 11384675,

716
38:26.992 --> 38:28.202
‎Park Gwang-cheol.

717
38:29.453 --> 38:31.163
‎OPERATION TIME, TIME, ANESTHESIA TIME

718
38:35.126 --> 38:35.960
‎Scalpel.

719
38:41.841 --> 38:44.218
‎The induction was uneventful, ‎and her vitals are good.

720
38:44.301 --> 38:46.095
‎Then we'll begin with the time-out.

721
38:46.178 --> 38:48.055
‎Ms. Lee Ju-hui's subtotal…

722
39:20.129 --> 39:21.130
‎Wipe.

723
39:25.968 --> 39:26.844
‎Harmonic.

724
39:29.305 --> 39:30.306
‎Wipe.

725
39:39.190 --> 39:40.399
‎Vessel loop.

726
39:47.573 --> 39:48.407
‎Long Kelly.

727
39:57.541 --> 39:59.168
‎I see the SMA.

728
39:59.960 --> 40:01.378
‎Why are you surprised?

729
40:02.338 --> 40:03.756
‎This is nothing new.

730
40:17.478 --> 40:18.312
‎This…

731
40:19.897 --> 40:21.607
‎It shouldn't be like this.

732
40:21.690 --> 40:22.733
‎What's wrong, Dr. Do?

733
40:27.279 --> 40:28.405
‎It's spread too much.

734
40:29.532 --> 40:31.617
‎It's worse than we expected.

735
40:32.535 --> 40:33.536
‎The vessel…

736
40:34.828 --> 40:37.289
‎-It's… ‎-It's completely encased by the tumor.

737
40:37.373 --> 40:40.042
‎It appears the SMA invasion is severe.

738
40:42.253 --> 40:43.379
‎Yun-sik…

739
40:45.005 --> 40:46.257
‎What are you going to do?

740
41:02.189 --> 41:03.607
‎A partial resection

741
41:04.149 --> 41:05.442
‎won't change the prognosis.

742
41:06.110 --> 41:07.152
‎We…

743
41:09.029 --> 41:10.114
‎We'll have to close up.

744
41:12.700 --> 41:13.659
‎Dr. Do.

745
41:13.742 --> 41:16.579
‎He's not just any patient. ‎The hospital's fate rides on…

746
41:16.662 --> 41:17.496
‎Oh, the mic.

747
41:19.456 --> 41:20.457
‎Dr. Do.

748
41:21.959 --> 41:23.627
‎Are you really going to close up?

749
41:24.295 --> 41:25.129
‎What?

750
41:25.713 --> 41:27.339
‎What if I won't allow it?

751
41:27.423 --> 41:29.174
‎But Director…

752
41:29.883 --> 41:32.845
‎Any further resection could do the patient ‎more harm than good.

753
41:33.554 --> 41:36.473
‎Will you tell the patient you opened, ‎then closed him right back?

754
41:37.182 --> 41:38.267
‎But…

755
41:38.851 --> 41:40.019
‎Don't you think

756
41:40.728 --> 41:43.772
‎you should do everything you can now ‎so you can tell him that later?

757
41:57.745 --> 42:00.748
‎Then please contact ‎Mr. Park's next of kin…

758
42:01.248 --> 42:02.458
‎They're not here.

759
42:02.541 --> 42:04.126
‎No one came. Why would they?

760
42:04.710 --> 42:05.586
‎Damn it…

761
42:08.714 --> 42:10.424
‎Everyone's waiting for him to die.

762
42:11.592 --> 42:15.095
‎His family took turns calling ‎to ask about his chances of survival.

763
42:27.191 --> 42:28.651
‎This is Bu Seung-gwon.

764
42:33.322 --> 42:34.823
‎We're not religious.

765
42:35.324 --> 42:36.867
‎I need to try something.

766
42:37.910 --> 42:39.078
‎Should I take up a religion?

767
42:39.161 --> 42:40.829
‎If Ju-hui lives, yes.

768
42:41.664 --> 42:43.082
‎If she doesn't, no.

769
42:45.376 --> 42:46.585
‎It'll be their loss.

770
42:49.922 --> 42:51.298
‎Go grab a bite to eat.

771
42:52.049 --> 42:53.050
‎I'm fine.

772
42:53.133 --> 42:55.177
‎Ju-hui went in on an empty stomach.

773
42:56.220 --> 42:57.554
‎I can hold on too.

774
43:04.603 --> 43:06.438
‎There's a chocolate bar in the back.

775
43:13.779 --> 43:14.655
‎Yeong-seon.

776
43:16.573 --> 43:17.700
‎Look what I found.

777
43:17.783 --> 43:21.036
‎TO MY FAMILY

778
43:25.916 --> 43:27.459
‎Transecting the pancreas.

779
43:27.543 --> 43:29.253
‎Black 60 stapler.

780
43:33.966 --> 43:34.800
‎This is good.

781
43:35.384 --> 43:36.760
‎The adhesion isn't too bad.

782
43:37.761 --> 43:39.430
‎It's still pretty big.

783
43:46.854 --> 43:48.939
‎I'll get it. Please focus on the surgery.

784
43:49.648 --> 43:50.524
‎This is OR 5.

785
43:50.607 --> 43:51.817
‎Right angle.

786
43:51.900 --> 43:54.653
‎I'm Park Tae-gyeong, an intern. ‎Please go ahead.

787
43:57.781 --> 43:58.699
‎Not bad.

788
43:59.867 --> 44:03.454
‎Tell Dr. Gye to come to OR 1.

789
44:04.413 --> 44:05.414
‎Excuse me?

790
44:07.374 --> 44:10.002
‎But Dr. Gye is in the middle of surgery.

791
44:10.085 --> 44:11.920
‎Just have her come.

792
44:17.718 --> 44:19.553
‎I'm sorry, Director. I can't do that.

793
44:19.636 --> 44:21.555
‎We need more time here.

794
44:21.638 --> 44:23.807
‎Dr. Gye needs to operate longer…

795
44:25.476 --> 44:27.311
‎This is Dr. Gye. I'm on my way.

796
44:29.480 --> 44:30.647
‎Dr. Gye?

797
44:31.356 --> 44:33.776
‎Are you giving up on Ms. Lee?

798
44:33.859 --> 44:35.194
‎-Move. ‎-Why?

799
44:35.277 --> 44:36.653
‎Because she's not a VIP?

800
44:36.737 --> 44:38.572
‎Because she's from ‎a low-income, disabled family?

801
44:38.655 --> 44:39.907
‎Priority.

802
44:39.990 --> 44:42.910
‎By priority, do you mean success?

803
44:42.993 --> 44:45.329
‎Is that the kind of doctor you are?

804
44:45.412 --> 44:46.580
‎I said move.

805
44:46.663 --> 44:50.959
‎Even when other doctors criticized you ‎for chasing money and success,

806
44:51.043 --> 44:53.003
‎I never believed it.

807
44:53.086 --> 44:54.671
‎So how could you do this?

808
44:55.923 --> 44:57.382
‎You're a doctor!

809
44:57.466 --> 44:59.551
‎You have a duty to save your patient!

810
44:59.635 --> 45:01.178
‎You promised her a hundred years!

811
45:01.970 --> 45:03.847
‎You swore to save her ‎as long as she's breathing.

812
45:13.357 --> 45:14.525
‎Now it's starting to get fun.

813
45:33.752 --> 45:35.003
‎You're a doctor!

814
45:35.087 --> 45:37.172
‎You have a duty to save your patient!

815
45:37.256 --> 45:38.674
‎You promised her a hundred years!

816
45:40.217 --> 45:42.010
‎You swore to save her ‎as long as she's breathing.

817
45:51.770 --> 45:53.564
‎-What are you… ‎-I called her.

818
45:53.647 --> 45:55.691
‎-Director Bu! ‎-I'm taking over.

819
45:57.317 --> 45:59.361
‎Sir, you can't do this!

820
45:59.444 --> 46:02.072
‎Wait a minute. Then…

821
46:02.155 --> 46:04.908
‎-Who's in charge in OR 5? ‎-Go there if you're worried.

822
46:04.992 --> 46:06.034
‎Why, you mad dog…

823
46:07.995 --> 46:10.455
‎Are you insane? ‎Did you abandon the patient?

824
46:10.539 --> 46:12.833
‎Dr. Bae is already on his way.

825
46:13.500 --> 46:15.294
‎Out of the way.

826
46:17.629 --> 46:19.047
‎Move!

827
46:19.840 --> 46:20.799
‎Dr. Gye.

828
46:21.758 --> 46:22.968
‎I'm counting on you.

829
46:39.693 --> 46:41.778
‎As expected. Please move.

830
46:42.362 --> 46:43.280
‎What will you do?

831
46:55.417 --> 46:59.880
‎RESECTION PHASE ‎(RESECTION AND VASCULAR DISSECTION)

832
47:05.427 --> 47:07.429
‎We're going to harvest ‎the great saphenous vein.

833
47:07.512 --> 47:09.473
‎-What? ‎-Let's open up the drape and prep the leg.

834
47:09.556 --> 47:11.099
‎Scissors, please.

835
47:11.183 --> 47:12.351
‎The leg? Why?

836
47:12.934 --> 47:14.227
‎What do you think you're doing?

837
47:14.311 --> 47:16.271
‎Why are you changing the procedure? ‎My next surgery is--

838
47:16.355 --> 47:18.607
‎Please get Dr. Jo from OR 5.

839
47:18.690 --> 47:20.692
‎What? Hey!

840
47:20.776 --> 47:21.818
‎Understood.

841
47:21.902 --> 47:24.738
‎Dr. Kim, please go to OR 5.

842
47:24.821 --> 47:26.698
‎That won't be necessary.

843
47:32.412 --> 47:34.081
‎Keep the mean BP at 70.

844
47:34.164 --> 47:35.874
‎You too, Dr. Jo?

845
47:35.957 --> 47:37.542
‎How could you leave a patient like this?

846
47:37.626 --> 47:40.170
‎Try caring about work ethic all the time.

847
47:44.800 --> 47:46.968
‎-EBL? ‎-It's 100 cc.

848
47:48.804 --> 47:50.055
‎Prep for vascular anastomosis.

849
47:50.138 --> 47:52.307
‎Get 7-0 Prolene and the loupes ready.

850
47:52.391 --> 47:54.142
‎Don't tell me you're trying to get…

851
47:55.602 --> 47:56.436
‎that ‎vessel.

852
47:56.520 --> 47:59.439
‎I guess all that research ‎has really sharpened your eye.

853
47:59.940 --> 48:00.941
‎You.

854
48:01.441 --> 48:02.818
‎I'd like you to assist me.

855
48:02.901 --> 48:04.569
‎Get which vessel?

856
48:04.653 --> 48:06.655
‎I need to know ‎what you're doing to assist.

857
48:08.615 --> 48:09.908
‎We'll now begin

858
48:10.575 --> 48:12.577
‎an en bloc Whipple with SMA resection.

859
48:13.245 --> 48:14.788
‎What?

860
48:15.872 --> 48:16.832
‎Wait…

861
48:27.551 --> 48:28.510
‎Are you saying…

862
48:29.845 --> 48:32.764
‎she finished this in an hour?

863
48:33.849 --> 48:34.933
‎Yes.

864
48:35.016 --> 48:37.894
‎Dr. Bae, did the surgery go well?

865
48:38.854 --> 48:40.063
‎In just an hour?

866
48:40.689 --> 48:41.857
‎And there's no bleeding.

867
48:41.940 --> 48:43.567
‎What kind of doctor says that?

868
48:43.650 --> 48:44.735
‎What?

869
48:45.902 --> 48:47.028
‎Hemostasis.

870
48:47.112 --> 48:50.991
‎Yes. Dr. Jo said hemostasis was complete.

871
48:52.993 --> 48:53.869
‎So this…

872
48:55.620 --> 48:57.581
‎This is Gye Su-jeong's work?

873
48:59.416 --> 49:01.877
‎We'll harvest the great saphenous vein ‎from the femoral region,

874
49:01.960 --> 49:05.046
‎followed by an en bloc resection ‎of the pancreatic cancer,

875
49:05.130 --> 49:06.173
‎including the SMA and SMV.

876
49:06.256 --> 49:08.425
‎We'll reconstruct the SMA ‎with the great saphenous vein.

877
49:08.508 --> 49:11.595
‎For the SMV, we'll use ‎an 8 mm synthetic graft.

878
49:11.678 --> 49:12.721
‎Hold on!

879
49:13.180 --> 49:14.473
‎What are you saying?

880
49:14.556 --> 49:17.309
‎Dr. Do, does she mean…

881
49:17.392 --> 49:19.770
‎Are you crazy? ‎Are you practicing on a patient?

882
49:19.853 --> 49:21.563
‎-You're really doing this? ‎-Yes.

883
49:21.646 --> 49:23.273
‎You can't take such a risk!

884
49:23.982 --> 49:25.108
‎If you fail, he'll die.

885
49:25.192 --> 49:27.152
‎He'll die from bowel necrosis!

886
49:27.235 --> 49:28.445
‎Dr. Do Yun-sik.

887
49:30.947 --> 49:32.532
‎Follow Dr. Gye's lead.

888
49:33.742 --> 49:36.286
‎Also, just for the record,

889
49:36.912 --> 49:38.580
‎Dr. Gye was never in this OR.

890
49:43.084 --> 49:44.669
‎A self-retaining retractor ‎and loupes, please.

891
50:50.402 --> 50:51.236
‎Harmonic.

892
51:03.915 --> 51:05.584
‎EBL is 320 cc.

893
51:05.667 --> 51:07.419
‎Bowel anastomosis complete.

894
51:08.545 --> 51:10.922
‎Please monitor the drain output ‎for any signs of bleeding.

895
51:11.006 --> 51:12.465
‎But you can do that yourself…

896
51:14.384 --> 51:15.468
‎Wait, are you clocking…

897
51:17.053 --> 51:19.890
‎This is the least he can do ‎to save face as a senior physician.

898
51:46.875 --> 51:47.792
‎Director Bu.

899
51:48.877 --> 51:51.671
‎Double surgeries mean double the fees.

900
51:52.464 --> 51:54.215
‎I give you my word

901
51:54.299 --> 51:57.093
‎this will remain confidential ‎from the family and outsiders.

902
51:58.511 --> 52:00.180
‎-Understood. ‎-However,

903
52:00.764 --> 52:01.765
‎you'll need to pay in cash.

904
52:03.183 --> 52:04.017
‎I'll be back soon.

905
52:42.597 --> 52:43.640
‎I'm sorry, sir.

906
52:44.891 --> 52:46.017
‎Yun-sik.

907
52:47.560 --> 52:49.229
‎Your first instinct was to close up.

908
52:51.231 --> 52:53.858
‎You didn't consider trying anything else.

909
52:54.484 --> 52:56.194
‎Your first thought was to quit.

910
52:56.277 --> 52:57.946
‎-But-- ‎-At that moment,

911
52:59.280 --> 53:00.907
‎you'd already left the OR.

912
53:03.827 --> 53:04.911
‎I didn't leave!

913
53:08.790 --> 53:09.958
‎I offered to assist

914
53:10.667 --> 53:12.127
‎and stayed to the very end…

915
53:14.295 --> 53:15.296
‎to be useful somehow.

916
53:16.464 --> 53:18.675
‎Do you know how humiliating that is?

917
53:20.218 --> 53:22.929
‎Facing that overwhelming wall,

918
53:23.555 --> 53:25.682
‎knowing my skills ‎aren't good enough to clear it…

919
53:28.101 --> 53:28.977
‎I…

920
53:33.440 --> 53:34.441
‎I still…

921
53:35.275 --> 53:37.277
‎stayed in the OR until the very end.

922
53:37.777 --> 53:38.903
‎I still held on.

923
53:40.905 --> 53:42.449
‎And I'll continue to hold on.

924
53:43.033 --> 53:43.867
‎And…

925
53:47.162 --> 53:50.040
‎I'll make my mark at this hospital…

926
53:51.583 --> 53:53.501
‎and achieve everything I've dreamed of.

927
53:54.878 --> 53:55.754
‎Director Bu.

928
53:56.838 --> 53:57.756
‎You know, right?

929
54:01.968 --> 54:03.011
‎You know my dream.

930
54:09.976 --> 54:10.810
‎All right.

931
54:12.520 --> 54:13.480
‎I understand.

932
54:26.159 --> 54:29.120
‎He's so tacky and old-fashioned.

933
54:29.662 --> 54:30.789
‎And his skills aren't good.

934
54:31.456 --> 54:32.999
‎But he was pretty cool just now.

935
54:33.917 --> 54:34.751
‎Yeah.

936
54:36.544 --> 54:38.296
‎Why are you crouching back here?

937
54:39.089 --> 54:41.049
‎Oh, have you seen Dr. Gye?

938
54:42.467 --> 54:44.094
‎That name just ruined the moment.

939
54:44.677 --> 54:45.678
‎Gye Su-jeong.

940
54:46.179 --> 54:48.431
‎You went overboard ‎telling him to watch her.

941
54:48.515 --> 54:51.518
‎Why are you looking for Dr. Gye ‎in the men's locker room?

942
54:51.601 --> 54:52.811
‎Oh, you're right.

943
54:53.394 --> 54:55.271
‎-Why? ‎-Well, earlier…

944
54:57.357 --> 54:58.525
‎It's nothing, sir.

945
55:01.194 --> 55:03.029
‎Did she really take it out in an hour?

946
55:03.113 --> 55:03.988
‎Yeah.

947
55:04.656 --> 55:06.574
‎I think

948
55:07.075 --> 55:10.036
‎she'd already planned to ‎perform both surgeries.

949
55:10.120 --> 55:11.704
‎-It's impossible otherwise. ‎-Really?

950
55:11.788 --> 55:12.747
‎Darn it.

951
55:14.040 --> 55:15.250
‎I had no idea.

952
55:15.834 --> 55:17.293
‎Please excuse me.

953
55:21.297 --> 55:22.549
‎What's wrong with him?

954
56:22.483 --> 56:24.611
‎TO MY FAMILY

955
56:24.694 --> 56:26.279
‎To my family.

956
56:26.362 --> 56:27.238
‎MY AUNT, ME, MY MOM

957
56:27.822 --> 56:29.657
‎Dear Mom and Aunt‎…

958
56:29.741 --> 56:33.203
‎Just in case I die today ‎instead of a hundred years from now‎…

959
56:34.287 --> 56:35.496
‎The two of you

960
56:36.372 --> 56:38.499
‎love me only because ‎I'm your daughter and niece.

961
56:39.751 --> 56:42.629
‎Otherwise, I don't think ‎you would've really liked me.

962
56:43.588 --> 56:44.797
‎But you know what?

963
56:45.298 --> 56:46.716
‎Even if you weren't my mom

964
56:47.425 --> 56:48.635
‎or my aunt,

965
56:49.719 --> 56:51.179
‎I think I would've liked you.

966
56:53.514 --> 56:54.724
‎Both of you are

967
56:55.350 --> 56:57.393
‎amazing and wonderful people.

968
56:58.728 --> 57:00.521
‎That's what I wanted to tell you,

969
57:01.981 --> 57:04.192
‎instead of things like "I love you."

970
57:05.777 --> 57:07.987
‎-I'm here. About my shares-- ‎-You're denying it?

971
57:08.071 --> 57:11.950
‎-It was you, wasn't it? ‎-No, are you serious? It wasn't me.

972
57:12.033 --> 57:14.827
‎What are you talking about? ‎I suggested the opposite.

973
57:14.911 --> 57:15.745
‎Oh, come on.

974
57:26.548 --> 57:27.840
‎Let's get along better

975
57:28.341 --> 57:29.926
‎next time we meet.

976
57:30.885 --> 57:32.845
‎But not as each other's caregivers.

977
57:33.846 --> 57:36.933
‎Let's just have fun together.

978
57:38.768 --> 57:40.186
‎Promise we'll meet again.

979
57:55.702 --> 57:57.662
‎-I bought beer. ‎-Great!

980
57:57.745 --> 57:59.956
‎-Does she know we're having bulgogi? ‎-Yeah.

981
58:00.790 --> 58:02.500
‎She's probably over there right now.

982
58:02.584 --> 58:03.626
‎Goodness.

983
58:03.710 --> 58:05.712
‎She must be so excited.

984
58:07.046 --> 58:08.798
‎Of course

985
58:08.881 --> 58:09.882
‎I'm excited too

986
58:09.966 --> 58:12.468
‎Money's coming in

987
58:12.552 --> 58:14.178
‎My wallet is smiling

988
58:14.262 --> 58:16.723
‎I'm so happy

989
58:16.806 --> 58:20.101
‎LUCKY BATHHOUSE

990
58:36.159 --> 58:38.953
‎BANANA MILK

991
58:40.163 --> 58:43.249
‎This is from Chairman Park Gwang-cheol.

992
58:43.333 --> 58:46.336
‎He wants the surgical team ‎to have dinner on him.

993
58:46.419 --> 58:47.754
‎All the more reason

994
58:48.588 --> 58:49.922
‎for me to take it then.

995
59:26.501 --> 59:28.628
‎CHAIRMAN PARK IN RECOVERY ‎SEARCH AND SEIZURE OF SUN &amp; STEEL

996
59:28.711 --> 59:29.545
‎That's right.

997
59:29.629 --> 59:32.465
‎You need to be alive ‎to face punishment and pay the price.

998
59:33.299 --> 59:36.219
‎Let's see how long you live, Chairman.

999
59:50.316 --> 59:51.818
‎Look up that procedure right now.

1000
59:51.901 --> 59:53.736
‎-I want details. Hurry up. ‎-Okay.

1001
59:54.445 --> 59:58.366
‎Dr. Gye probably planned to use ‎that procedure before going in, right?

1002
59:58.449 --> 59:59.784
‎That's not important.

1003
01:00:00.368 --> 01:00:02.412
‎What matters is its implication.

1004
01:00:02.495 --> 01:00:04.372
‎Which is?

1005
01:00:08.710 --> 01:00:10.086
‎That she's a mad dog

1006
01:00:11.087 --> 01:00:13.840
‎who'll push ahead with surgery ‎no matter the risk to the patient

1007
01:00:14.549 --> 01:00:15.925
‎for her own success.

1008
01:00:23.349 --> 01:00:25.435
‎Dr. Gye, why are you here ‎and not at your desk?

1009
01:00:26.561 --> 01:00:28.980
‎The suck-ups in surgery kicked me out.

1010
01:00:30.481 --> 01:00:32.275
‎Oh, the thing is…

1011
01:00:32.358 --> 01:00:33.985
‎It's okay. I'm fine here.

1012
01:00:35.903 --> 01:00:38.573
‎I already delivered your pay ‎to Ms. Jang for this case.

1013
01:00:38.656 --> 01:00:39.782
‎It was a tall order,

1014
01:00:40.867 --> 01:00:42.076
‎so I'm grateful.

1015
01:00:43.661 --> 01:00:45.163
‎It wasn't much of a tall order.

1016
01:00:47.123 --> 01:00:48.124
‎Dr. Gye Su-jeong.

1017
01:00:52.128 --> 01:00:52.962
‎I found it.

1018
01:00:54.922 --> 01:00:58.092
‎So this is the procedure ‎that Dr. Gye used.

1019
01:00:58.176 --> 01:01:00.470
‎There's an article about it ‎from seven years ago.

1020
01:01:00.553 --> 01:01:01.471
‎Okay.

1021
01:01:02.346 --> 01:01:05.600
‎"The GI surgery team at ‎Cubanacan University of Medical Sciences

1022
01:01:06.184 --> 01:01:10.313
‎successfully performed an en bloc Whipple ‎with an SMA reconstruction."

1023
01:01:11.481 --> 01:01:13.775
‎"It promised a cure for a patient

1024
01:01:13.858 --> 01:01:17.361
‎who had previously been ‎considered inoperable."

1025
01:01:18.780 --> 01:01:21.449
‎"However, the patient died

1026
01:01:22.074 --> 01:01:23.868
‎two months after the surgery."

1027
01:01:31.667 --> 01:01:33.878
‎You're bound to fail at some point.

1028
01:01:41.719 --> 01:01:43.930
‎It seems like you've already failed, sir.

1029
01:01:51.229 --> 01:01:54.774
‎"The cause of death remains unknown."

1030
01:02:31.978 --> 01:02:33.980
‎"The surgeon's name was not revealed."

1031
01:02:36.148 --> 01:02:37.984
‎"But the pseudonym in the chart was‎…

1032
01:02:39.861 --> 01:02:41.988
‎Doctor X."

1033
01:02:42.071 --> 01:02:43.322
‎DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE

1034
01:03:23.321 --> 01:03:25.740
‎DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE

1035
01:03:25.823 --> 01:03:29.368
‎Are you saying Dr. Gye is Doctor X?

1036
01:03:29.452 --> 01:03:30.369
‎What are you doing?

1037
01:03:30.453 --> 01:03:32.455
‎We're losing blood faster ‎than we're losing time.

1038
01:03:32.538 --> 01:03:34.332
‎Don't you dare do it every day!

1039
01:03:35.333 --> 01:03:37.043
‎The hospital's been ‎in an uproar these days

1040
01:03:37.126 --> 01:03:39.003
‎-because of her? ‎-Transfer her now.

1041
01:03:39.086 --> 01:03:41.547
‎No. We must treat her here ‎no matter what.

1042
01:03:41.631 --> 01:03:43.591
‎We have someone who can operate.

1043
01:03:43.674 --> 01:03:46.385
‎I temporarily assigned a new doctor here.

1044
01:03:46.469 --> 01:03:48.387
‎-Who is it? ‎-The surgery has begun.

1045
01:03:48.471 --> 01:03:49.513
‎Fire her right now.

1046
01:03:49.597 --> 01:03:51.390
‎We need to ban her from medicine!

1047
01:03:51.474 --> 01:03:54.060
‎Dr. Gye, please wake up!

1048
01:03:54.143 --> 01:03:59.148
‎Subtitle translation by: Jenny Kim
